        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cotton seed, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cotton seed, at regional storehouse
Inventory refers to 1kg cotton seed, at regional storehouse. ;
UUID: dd6c3263-79bb-3aa6-9f77-a29152d2acda
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. 
Location: Refers to an average production in the USA
Technology: conventional production typical for the country
Time period:  
Production volume:  
Sampling: Data come from rape seed inventory and own estimation for transports. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dd6c3263-79bb-3aa6-9f77-a29152d2acda.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
